  "description": "On-device LLM inference for Circle. Alibaba MNN P/Invoke layer with Qwen 3 chat generator. 1.3.3 ships the osx-arm64 native payload — libmnnbridge.dylib (62 KB C ABI shim built against MNN 3.5.0 with Apple Clang 17 on macOS 26.5 / SDK 26.0 / -DCMAKE_OSX_ARCHITECTURES=arm64 -DCMAKE_OSX_DEPLOYMENT_TARGET=12.0) + libMNN.dylib (15.4 MB universal x86_64+arm64 from MNN.framework). install_name rewritten to @rpath/libmnnbridge.dylib and LC_LOAD_DYLIB rewritten from MNN.framework/Versions/A/MNN to @rpath/libMNN.dylib so the consumer's runtimes/osx-arm64/native/ layout resolves end-to-end via @loader_path. NOT codesigned/notarised — consuming app must codesign for distribution to end-user Macs (Gatekeeper). Server-deployed CLI use works unmodified. 1.3.2 added linux-x64. 1.3.1 fixed Windows.",
